<title>FINLAND: Finland Bank reserves up FIM 176 mln in week.</title>
<headline>Finland Bank reserves up FIM 176 mln in week.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland's latest balance sheet for the week to December 5 showed the following positions in millions of markka compared to November 29.</p>
<p> Position			   Latest     Previous</p>
<p> Foreign reserves		 37,160	 36,985</p>
<p> Money market intervention    11,598	  7,041</p>
<p> Govt sector claims		5,991	  5,987</p>
<p> Corporate sector claims	 2,271	  2,271</p>
<p> Total assets		     65,734	 60,989</p>
<p>In the previous week to November 29, reserves rose by 33 million markka.</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom +358-0-680 50 245</p>
</text>
